 succeeded in 0ms:
   260	```
   261	
   262	### 5.3 Method
   263	
   264	```yaml
   265	# acot/configs/methods/_base.yaml —— 所有方法共享的默认值;每个字段都显式写出
   266	name: _base
   267	control: {ex_source: track, frame_gain: 0.0, commit_k: 5, ablate: null, shuffle_seed: 0}
   268	identity:
   269	  memory_seed: committed                    # --gallery-seed;取 gt 即为真值通道
   270	  conf_tau: 0.0
   271	  conf_consensus: 0.0
   272	  reanchor: {mode: off, patience: 5, tavg: 0.0}       # mode: off | lang | oracle(oracle 为真值通道)
   273	  cold: {window: 0, lambda: 0.9, single: false}        # COLD_*,只用于复现 V2 实验
   274	filter: {mode: off}
   275	diagnostics: []
   276	```
   277	
   278	```yaml
   279	# acot/configs/methods/ours_final.yaml
   280	name: ours_final
   281	extends: _base
   282	identity:
   283	  head: tah
   284	  tah: {ckpt: "artefact:tah_relm_dag", lang_reanchor_thr: 0.60}
   285	  conf_tau: 0.5                             # 提交门控(head=reid 且开启重锚时，还兼作低置信阈值)
   286	filter:                                     # ASD / PGIF;ASD 构造函数的全部字段，显式写出
   287	  mode: filter
   288	  filter_kind: tempered
   289	  resid_decay: 0.98
   290	  absent_hold: true
   291	  absent_max: 8
   292	  conf_window: 30
   293	  gate_memory: true
   294	  gate_tah: true
   295	  gate_dam: true
   296	  naive: false
   297	  alpha: null
   298	  q_lo: 0.2
   299	  q_hi: 0.7
   300	  eps_switch: 0.01
   301	  anchor_mode: first
   302	  k_anchor: 3
   303	  beta_lang: 0.25
   304	  lang_ema: 0.7
   305	  tau: 0.1
   306	  kappa: 0.25
   307	  h: 2.0
   308	  refractory: 3
   309	  learned_ckpt: null
   310	  v1_selfreset: false
   311	```
   312	
   313	```yaml
   314	# acot/configs/methods/ext_dam4sam.yaml
   315	name: ext_dam4sam
   316	extends: _base
   317	identity:
   318	  head: dam4sam
   319	  dam4sam: {gate_px: 160, every_frame: false, reinit_cooldown: 3, service: dam4sam}   # gate_px → --assoc-gate-px(DAM4SAM 复用该参数)
   320	  conf_tau: 0.05
   321	```
   322	
   323	方法 YAML 覆盖当前所有臂：
   324	- 主方法 `ours_final`;
   325	- H-A,即 `ours_final` 加开局消融 `module: head`;
   326	- 开局变体 v2–v4;
   327	- PGIF 的各个变体;
   328	- 外部基线：DAM4SAM、DeepSORT/OC-SORT 关联、reid;
   329	- 语言 head:xattn;
   330	- 诊断臂:oracle_id、oracle_absent、gt_seeded、road_oracle、attrbind、ex_source 消融。
   331	
   332	`tid_head` 每个取值实际读取哪些 kwarg,在 P0a 生成「参数使用矩阵」(例如 DAM4SAM 复用 `assoc_gate_px`)。schema 按这个矩阵校验：只允许当前 head 用到的字段出现。
   333	
   334	### 5.4 种子登记:`acot/configs/seeds.yaml`
   335	
   336	```yaml
   337	seedsets:
   338	  datagen_mvp_v5:   {list_file: runs/tah_v90/b_manifest.json#seeds, purpose: train_data}   # 任意列表(含替补 108+)
   339	  train_dagger_v2:  {ranges: [[97000, 97105]], exclude: [97077], purpose: train}           # 97077:Town02 生成失败
   340	  dev:              {ranges: [[91000, 91020]], purpose: dev}
   341	  dev2:             {ranges: [[93000, 93100]], purpose: dev}
   342	  heldout_opening:  {ranges: [[93100, 93660]], purpose: heldout}
   343	  test:             {ranges: [[95000, 96000]], purpose: test, locked: true}
   344	substitutes: {datagen_mvp_v5: {from_manifest: runs/tah_v90/b_manifest.json#substitutes}}
   345	rules: {disjoint_across_purposes: true, test_requires: [--allow-test, prereg_ref]}
   346	```
   347	
   348	- 种子可以用 `ranges`、`list`、`list_file` 三种方式给出，也可以组合;另有 `exclude` 和替补映射。
   349	- 实际种子以迁移时核对 `collect_dagger.sh` 等脚本的结果为准。
   350	- 不同用途的种子集重叠时,`acot lint` 报错。
   351	- 使用 test 种子必须加 `--allow-test`,并引用预注册文档(`prereg_ref`)。
   352	
   353	### 5.5 Experiment
   354	
   355	```yaml
   356	# acot/configs/experiments/1004_final_table.yaml
   357	name: 1004_final_table
   358	protocol: sim_proxy_v2@1
   359	seeds: {set: dev, expect: 20}
   360	completeness: {require: all_complete, allow_skipped_reasons: [], pairing: strict}   # 失败即关闭(§12.1)
   361	retry: {infra_attempts: 2, retry_skipped: 0}
   362	arms:
   363	  ours:        {method: ours_final}
   364	  no_pgif:     {method: ours_final, override: {filter.mode: off}}
   365	  pgif_bayes:  {method: ours_final, override: {filter.filter_kind: bayes}}
   366	  open_head:   {method: ours_final, ablation: opening, override: {frontend.opening.module: head, frontend.opening.window: 1}}
   367	  ext_dam4sam: {method: ext_dam4sam}
   368	collect: [ticks, trk, gt_access, scenario]
   369	comparisons:
   370	  - {family: main, a: ours, b: [no_pgif, pgif_bayes, open_head, ext_dam4sam],
   371	     metrics: [committed, longC, longW], test: paired_bootstrap, correction: holm}
   372	```
